{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2026,10,28]],"date-time":"2026-10-28T20:31:49Z","timestamp":1793219509898,"version":"4.5.0"},"reference-count":25,"publisher":"IGI Global Scientific Publishing","issue":"1","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2026,5,18]],"date-time":"2026-05-18T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1779062400000},"content-version":"vor","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"http:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by\/3.0\/deed.en_US"},{"start":{"date-parts":[[2026,5,18]],"date-time":"2026-05-18T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1779062400000},"content-version":"am","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"http:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by\/3.0\/deed.en_US"},{"start":{"date-parts":[[2026,5,18]],"date-time":"2026-05-18T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1779062400000},"content-version":"tdm","delay-in-days":0,"URL":"http:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by\/3.0\/deed.en_US"}],"content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":[],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2026,5,18]]},"abstract":"<p>To address vague behavioral expression, temporal misalignment, and rating fluctuations in online teaching, this study develops a participation evaluation model by integrating Dynamic Time Warping (DTW) and Fuzzy Cross Entropy (FCE). Video streams are used to extract features such as gaze, facial expressions, and posture. A sliding window and DTW enable elastic temporal matching of behaviors, while FCE with fuzzy language mapping improves rating stability and fault tolerance. Experiments on two benchmark datasets show that with a window length of 5 and tolerance threshold of 0.2, the model achieved a mean square error of 0.030 and rating stability of 95.2%. In four simulated teaching environments, participation recognition accuracy reached 93.1%, average response delay was 48.2ms, and stability exceeded 0.88. The model's practical value is in complex online classrooms, offering a robust technical path for multimodal, time-sensitive evaluation. The study contributes to intelligent knowledge management in education by enabling real-time feedback and improved teaching quality.<\/p>","DOI":"10.4018\/ijkm.410301","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2026,5,18]],"date-time":"2026-05-18T16:30:53Z","timestamp":1779121853000},"page":"1-23","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":0,"title":["Knowledge-Driven Evaluation of Online Classroom Participation"],"prefix":"10.4018","volume":"22","author":[{"ORCID":"https:\/\/orcid.org\/0009-0007-0845-5527","authenticated-orcid":true,"given":"Mingzhe","family":"Wang","sequence":"first","affiliation":[{"name":"Yellow River Conservancy Technical University, China"}],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"2432","reference":[{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/s13369-023-08439-8"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/s11276-023-03515-1"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.30632\/PJV65N1-2024a7"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1109\/TSC.2023.3287189"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.5755\/j02.eie.35952"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.4018\/IJAEIS.372678"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.3233\/ICA-230731"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.jksuci.2023.101555"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.3233\/IDT-240684"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/s11042-022-13558-9"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1109\/JSEN.2023.3265688"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1007\/s12652-022-03745-9"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.3233\/JIFS-235044"},{"key":"IJKM.410301.-0","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.4785